# Secrets. Nothing here ever enters the repository.
# Wildcards cover both casings, since gitignore is case-sensitive on Linux and
# CI even though Windows is not. The convention is appsettings.Secrets.json.
*.Secrets.json
*.secrets.json
!*.Secrets.example.json
.env
.env.*

# .NET
bin/
obj/
# docs/evidence/ is deliberately tracked and must stay outside bin/. The phase P
# transcripts there are the evidence behind every figure in the Probe findings
# table, and while they were excluded from the repository nothing recorded in
# PROGRESS.md was checkable without the build machine [H.1]. They moved out of
# the probe's own output directory when 0.1 deleted it [O.9].
*.user
*.suo
.vs/

# Rider / VS Code
.idea/
.vscode/

# Agent tooling. Local session state, not repository content.
.claude/

# OS
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
